            "review_title": "Review at Doi Dep Coffee Lounge - Dining Nha Trang",
            "review_text": "EVA122014\nItaly24364 contributions\n40\nWhat a Local Show in Nha Trang !!!\nJan 2025 • Couples\nAfter turning inside the mall , we went out at the entrance of the beautiful Diamond Bay Hotel, curious we stopped to read the menu 'of this Restaurant / Cafe next to the Diamond , since we had to wait for our Driver who would pick us up nearby we decided to spend half an hour here waiting for a delicious coconut coffee and a cappuccino. The staff is very friendly and the place is amazing luxurious! Being a time of celebration, the place was wonderfully decorated with Red and Gold, which contrasted with the China Blue of the surrounding velvet! Congratulations indeed!\nRead more\nTranslated from Italian\nShow original\nWritten February 3, 2025",
